@startuml
title infiniFi: a loss from farm mark to iUSD price
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequence {
  ParticipantBackgroundColor #EAF6F0
  ParticipantBorderColor #2E8B67
  LifeLineBorderColor #2E8B67
}
participant "Farm" as F
participant "YieldSharingV3" as YS
participant "siUSD holder" as S
participant "iUSD holder" as I
participant "Keeper (ACCRUE_YIELD)" as K
F -> YS : assets() falls, unaccruedYield() < 0
note over YS : pending loss, applied to nobody
S -> YS : unstake through the gateway
YS --> S : revert PendingLossesUnapplied
I -> YS : redeem iUSD
YS --> I : paid at the old oracle price
K -> YS : accrue()
alt safety buffer >= loss
  YS -> YS : burn buffer iUSD
else
  YS -> YS : lockers, then siUSD, then iUSD price
end
@enduml
